                    "text": "Drawing from my passion for graphical design and research on urban impacts, I propose a concept centered around \"Introspective Urbanism\". This approach would prioritize individual mental wellness within smart city designs by creating adaptive modular stations that provide transparent surveillayer, meaningful. In addition to the visual indicators at each station, we can incorporate tactile elements and auditory cues for a multi-sensory experience, further enhancing accessibility and inclusivity. By engaging community members in the design process, these modular stations would become living examples of participatory urbanism that embrace diverse needs while fostering a sense of ownership among residents.",
