            "winning_proposal": "\"Fostering Intergenerational Solidarity in Future Cities: Designing Age-Friendly Urban Spaces Powered by AI and Sustainable Practices\" proposes an innovative approach to creating equitable urban environments that promote social cohesion across generations. By integrating age-specific data analytics with AI-driven smart technologies, this concept focuses on designing inclusive public spaces and services that enhance the quality of life for both elderly citizens and younger populations. The initiative aims to harmonize sustainability goals with intergenerational needs, ensuring accessible transportation, healthcare, social activities, and environmental stewardship, ultimately fostering stronger communities within future cities."
