                    "text": "\n\"Creating Intergenerational Green Spaces: AI-Enabled Urban Planning for Holistic Wellness, Social Connection, and Environmental Sustainability in Future Cities\" delves into the innovative integration of AI technologies with urban green space planning to design multi-functional areas that facilitate wellness across different age groups. By leveraging sensor data, IoT connectivity, and community inputs, planners can create adaptive environments that encourage physical activity, foster social ties, and promote mental health for young and old alike within the smart urban context. The focus on sustainability not only nurtures ecological balance but also strengthens intergenerational bonds, contributing to a more resilient, inclusive community fabric in future cities.",
